{"id":"kblwj0dihifw2tf0yg785v1fb","title":"滑石粉协同杀虫剂使用可降低大豆害虫防治成本","originalTitle":"Common clay shows promise for reducing soybean pests and insecticide costs","summary":"美国阿肯色州立大学与 USDA 农业部合作研究显示，滑石粉涂层可减少大豆卷叶蛾和绿头臭虫的产卵，降低杀虫剂使用量约20-25美元/公顷（按4-5次/季计算）。田间试验证实滑石粉单独使用即可减少害虫数量，与半量杀虫剂联用效果等同于全量杀虫剂。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-common-clay-soybean-pests-insecticide.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T14:40:01.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T15:20:38.441Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T15:20:38.441Z","category":"materials-energy","tags":["研究成果","Nature"],"score":58,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"9c3fc69a-5612-4c09-a357-43ffbfd35eef","title":"滑石粉与杀虫剂联用降低大豆害虫防治成本"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"9c3fc69a-5612-4c09-a357-43ffbfd35eef","title":"滑石粉与杀虫剂联用降低大豆害虫防治成本"}],"topics":[{"slug":"nature","name":"Nature"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f9mzkgs1k62g","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}